// DetailString :
"P1157554392" "When you rescued {GROUP_1_VAR_A}, she told you:<br><br>'I guess it was the pressure of the celebrity life that made me start taking Rage. Before I knew it, I was in over my head! The Tsoo wanted more money, and I just didn't have it! They said if I couldn't pay, they'd make an example of me. They were going to force me to participate in a Tsoo fox hunt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1829158232" "The famous singer {GROUP_1_VAR_A} has gone missing! Her agent, Charlie Sparks, thinks the Tsoo may have kidnapped her. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue {GROUP_1_VAR_A} from the Tsoo.</a> I don't know what they want with her, but I'm sure it isn't pleasant."
// AcceptString :
"P3770626750" "Rescue {GROUP_1_VAR_A} from the Tsoo"
// SendOffString :
"P3675577065" "See if you can find out why the Tsoo would kidnap a singer."

