// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1422633237" "{GROUP_1_VAR_B}'s okay?  Whew, thanks, {HeroName}. It says here that the Tsoo wanted to make her participate in their next fox hunt. Have you heard of those, {HeroName}? The Tsoo pump some poor soul full of Rage, release her, then hunt her down! They rarely kill the fox, but the hunts usually end in brutal beatings. It's a good thing you rescued {GROUP_1_VAR_B} when you did!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2405172358" "Believe it or not, Tsoo fox hunts usually involve willing prey. Some gangsters consider playing the fox a testament to their courage and wit. But I'm not surprised the Tsoo would try to force  {GROUP_1_VAR_A} into a hunt as punishment for failing to pay her debt. Nice rescue, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P2062136717" "I just saw an interview with {GROUP_1_VAR_A}. She said {HeroName} helped her clean up her life!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Tsoo_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3318090156" "The Tsoo are recruiting in earnest these days. If they grow much larger, we may not be able to deal with them effectively. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and take on a few Tsoo.</a> If you show people that the Tsoo aren't as tough as they look, maybe they won't be so eager to join up."
// AcceptString :
"P3800043641" "Hit the streets and take on a few Tsoo"
// SendOffString :
"P1937032343" "You can usually find Tsoo in Talos Island or Independence Port."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3599329613" "Combat Tsoo menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1034155721" "I need you to make an impression on people, {HeroName}. Show them that the Tsoo aren't as powerful as they pretend."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2628529507" "You have discouraged people from joining the Tsoo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P129425621" "I think you got the message out. Nobody will want to join the Tsoo if they know that {HeroName} is on their case."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Tsoo_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1716194739" "The Tsoo have been gaining a lot of territory in Independence Port, and it's causing a lot of problems. The port is Family territory, and every time the two gangs meet, it ends in violence. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to Independence Port and take back some territory from the Tsoo.</a> It could stop a lot of needless bloodshed."
// AcceptString :
"P2478370928" "Go to Independence Port and take back some territory from the Tsoo"
// SendOffString :
"P3211904725" "The Tsoo have been making headway in Bell Point and Wave landing. Maybe you should start in those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3099534461" "Take territory in Independence Port"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2869167523" "We could be looking at a lot of violent conflicts if you don't push back the Tsoo in Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P142203875" "You have taken back enough territory from the Tsoo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1356351146" "The Tsoo are bound and determined to tread on every other gang's toes. Let's just make sure they don't leave a wave of destruction in their wake."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Tsoo_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P401929256" "The seers over at MAGI have alerted me to a potential problem with the Tsoo. There's a huge concentration of Tsoo ancestral spirits over in Talos Island, and their presence threatens to tear apart the mystical fabric of that zone. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can get to Talos Island and cull the numbers of the Tsoo.</a> Maybe we can keep Talos Island in one piece."
// AcceptString :
"P185461021" "Go to Talos Island and cull the numbers of the Tsoo."
// SendOffString :
"P2057223411" "Helen Point and New Sparta are hotbeds of Tsoo activity. I recommend starting near those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4209111943" "Avert mystic rift in Talos Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3432668490" "I hear that the mystical energy in Talos Island is still out of control. Get over there and defeat some more Tsoo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1640137865" "You have prevented the Tsoo from causing a mystical rift in Talos Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3622777201" "I had no idea those Tsoo ancestral spirits were so dangerous! Thanks for taking care of them, {HeroName}."
